{"id":"6b2a5e68b8567a3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-large-sieve.md","title":"Large Sieve","display":"df-large-sieve — Large Sieve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-large-sieve","aliases":["58-df-large-sieve","Large Sieve"],"display":"df-large-sieve — Large Sieve","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-large-sieve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-large-sieve</span><span>Large Sieve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-large-sieve — Large Sieve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md\">../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,Q,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(N,Q,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md\">../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\varphi:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\psi\\;\\left(d\\mid q\\land d&lt;q\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\psi,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(n,q)=1\\to\\chi(n)=\\psi(n))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\psi\\;\\left(d\\mid q\\land d&lt;q\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\psi,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(n,q)=1\\to\\chi(n)=\\psi(n))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{r\\in\\omega:r&lt;q\\land\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}\\right|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{r\\in\\omega:r&lt;q\\land\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}\\right|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S(a,N,Q)\\leftrightarrow N,Q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\sum_{q=1}^{Q}\\frac{q}{\\varphi(q)}\\sum_{\\substack{\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\\\\\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)}}\\left|\\sum_{n=1}^{N}a(n)\\chi(n)\\right|^2\\leq(N+Q^2)\\sum_{n=1}^{N}|a(n)|^2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S(a,N,Q)\\leftrightarrow N,Q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\sum_{q=1}^{Q}\\frac{q}{\\varphi(q)}\\sum_{\\substack{\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\\\\\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)}}\\left|\\sum_{n=1}^{N}a(n)\\chi(n)\\right|^2\\leq(N+Q^2)\\sum_{n=1}^{N}|a(n)|^2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the multiplicative large-sieve inequality; the star condition is made explicit by the primitive-character predicate.</li>\n<li>Bombieri-Vinogradov: large sieve gives quasi Grand Riemann Hypothesis for Dirichlet</li>\n<li>Hybrid: bounds for sums over characters and moduli simultaneously</li>\n<li>Selberg: alternative sieve; convexity arguments for character sum bounds</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Montgomery, Topics in Multiplicative Number Theory</li>\n<li>Iwaniec and Kowalski, Analytic Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,Q,q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\neg\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists\\psi\\;\\left(d\\mid q\\land d<q\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\psi,d)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(n,q)=1\\to\\chi(n)=\\psi(n))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq\\left|\\{r\\in\\omega:r<q\\land\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}\\right|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}large\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\\mathrm{LargeSieveBound}_S(a,N,Q)\\leftrightarrow N,Q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land a:\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\sum_{q=1}^{Q}\\frac{q}{\\varphi(q)}\\sum_{\\substack{\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\\\\\\mathrm{PrimitiveDirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)}}\\left|\\sum_{n=1}^{N}a(n)\\chi(n)\\right|^2\\leq(N+Q^2)\\sum_{n=1}^{N}|a(n)|^2","display":true}],"bytes":1925,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-762","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-large-sieve.md|58-df-large-sieve]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["7101d8e1cbc25a43"]}